---

---

<section
  id="aboutme"
  class="w-full max-w-3xl min-h-[20vh] flex flex-col gap-4 p-4 scroll-mt-14"
>
  <h2 class="text-2xl uppercase font-black text-white">About Me</h2>
  <p class="font-medium text-[#B5B5C3]">
    I'm Adrián, a video editor with over 3 years of experience creating and
    editing digital content. I specialize in short-form content for TikTok and
    Instagram, focusing on engaging visuals, pacing, and storytelling.
  </p>
  <p class="font-medium text-[#B5B5C3]">
    I work primarily with Adobe Premiere Pro. From 2020 to 2023, I worked as a
    video editor creating content for YouTube, where I developed my skills in
    editing and visual storytelling.
  </p>
  <p class="font-medium text-[#B5B5C3]">
    Currently, I work as a content creator, producing video and image content
    using AI tools and exploring new ways to combine creativity and technology.
  </p>

  <p class="text-white">
    <blockquote
      class="border-l-2 border-r-2 border-neutral-300 px-6 py-4 text-xl italic text-neutral-400"
    >
      I never thought that editing videos would end up becoming something I
      wanted to do professionally.
    </blockquote>
   
  </p>
  <div class="grid w-full min-h-20 grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-4">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden outline outline-neutral-800"
    >
      <h2
        class="text-xl md:text-2xl uppercase font-black text-white text-center"
      >
        Growth Content
      </h2>
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="100"
        height="100"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="white"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-trending-up"
      >
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="iconGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#FFFFFF"></stop>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4B5563"></stop>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
          d="M3 17l6 -6l4 4l8 -8"></path><path d="M14 7l7 0l0 7"></path></svg
      >
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden outline outline-neutral-800"
    >
      <h2
        class="text-xl md:text-2xl uppercase font-black text-white text-center"
      >
        Fast Delivery
      </h2>
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="80"
        height='80"'
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="white"
        stroke-width="1"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-clock-bolt"
      >
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="iconGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#F8FAFC"></stop>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1F2937"></stop>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
          d="M20.984 12.53a9 9 0 1 0 -7.552 8.355"></path><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"
        ></path><path d="M19 16l-2 3h4l-2 3"></path></svg
      >
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden outline outline-neutral-800"
    >
      <h2
        class="text-xl md:text-2xl uppercase font-black text-white text-center"
      >
        Research
      </h2>
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="50"
        height="50"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="white"
        stroke-width="1"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-search"
      >
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="iconGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#F8FAFC"></stop>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1F2937"></stop>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
          d="M3 10a7 7 0 1 0 14 0a7 7 0 1 0 -14 0"></path><path d="M21 21l-6 -6"
        ></path></svg
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
